fix(money): TD-MONEY-01 M1 finishing - wire wallet_ledger write paths (D-050)

Background
----------
M1 (PR #54) shipped the wallet_ledger table + WalletService read path +
an offline backfill script, but production write paths were never
wired. M2/M3 jumped straight to reconciliation, leaving:

  1. wallet_ledger empty in prod (only manual backfill could populate it)
  2. WalletService.get_summary always falling back to legacy
     OrderRepository.sum_earnings_by_companion aggregation
  3. M3 incremental reconciliation would flag every successful payment
     as MISSING_PAYMENT against an empty ledger -> autofix queue flooded

This PR finishes the M1 design intent.

Changes
-------
- New `app/services/wallet_ledger_writer.py` (`WalletLedgerWriter`):
  single-purpose idempotent appender. (provider_txn_id, direction)
  unique constraint as backstop; begin_nested SAVEPOINT isolation;
  caller controls commit boundary.

- PaymentService now appends ledger on three success paths:
  * mock provider instant pay success
  * handle_pay_callback success (real wechat path)
  * mock provider instant refund success
  * handle_refund_callback success
  All wrapped in `_append_*_safe` helpers - ledger failures DO NOT
  break the main payment business logic, only log error.

- Idempotency keys:
  * pay:    provider_txn_id = trade_no (fallback payment.id)
  * refund: provider_txn_id = refund_id (fallback "{trade_no}:refund"
    or "{payment.id}:refund") to avoid clashing with the original pay
  * adjust: provider_txn_id = "ADJ-{operator}-{uuid8}" (server-generated)

- New admin API for manual adjustments:
  * POST /api/v1/admin/wallet-ledger/adjustments
    requires X-Admin-Token + X-Admin-Operator; writes
    admin_audit_logs row + ledger row in same UoW
  * GET  /api/v1/admin/wallet-ledger/{user_id}
    diagnostic list endpoint with paging + reason filter

- WalletLedgerWriter validates manual adjustments strictly:
  amount > 0, operator non-empty (<=64), reason non-empty (<=500).

Tests
-----
1053 -> 1086 passed (+33 new):
  - 13 writer unit tests (3 entry points, idempotency, validation)
  - 7 PaymentService -> ledger integration tests (mock + wechat callback)
  - 13 admin API tests (auth, happy paths, validation, list)
Full suite green; CI Smoke + Tests expected to stay green.

Refs ADR-0032 / TD-MONEY-01 M1 / D-050
